---
import Layout from '../../components/layout/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_URL } from '../../config';
import { buildBreadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';

const title = 'Cookie Policy: no cookies on this Spanish salary site';
const description = 'Cookie policy: our Spanish net salary calculators set no cookies and store nothing. Only an anonymous stability check with cookieless Microsoft Clarity.';

const schemas = [
  buildBreadcrumbSchema([
    { name: 'Home', url: '/en/' },
    { name: 'Cookie Policy', url: '/en/cookie-policy/' },
  ]),
];
const faqPage = [
  { question: 'What cookies does this site use?', answer: 'None. Neither we nor any third party set cookies when you use the Spanish salary, IRPF or severance calculators, and nothing is written to localStorage or sessionStorage. The gross salary, region and family details you type in stay in the open tab and are gone when you close it.' },
  { question: 'Why is there no cookie banner?', answer: 'Because there is nothing to accept or refuse: no cookie is placed. The calculators, guides and shareable links all work the same for every visitor.' },
  { question: 'What does Microsoft Clarity do here?', answer: 'It is loaded in cookieless mode to spot technical problems: JavaScript errors, slow pages, clicks that do nothing, scrolling issues on mobile. Each page view gets its own identifier, visits are not linked together, and page content and form inputs are masked before anything is sent.' },
  { question: 'How can I opt out of the stability measurement?', answer: 'Block the domain clarity.ms in your browser or with a content blocker, or write to contact@elsueldoneto.es. Every calculator keeps working without it.' },
];
const faqPageSchema = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'FAQPage', mainEntity: faqPage.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.question, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.answer } })) };
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} schema={schemas} locale="en">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8">
    <nav class="mb-6 text-sm text-medium-gray">
      <a href="/en/" class="hover:text-brand">Home</a> / <span class="text-charcoal dark:text-gray-200">Cookie Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-charcoal md:text-4xl dark:text-gray-100">Cookie Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-dark-gray dark:text-gray-300 space-y-6">
      <p><em>Last updated: October {new Date().getFullYear()}</em></p>

      <p>
        <strong>{SITE_NAME}</strong> ({SITE_URL}) sets no cookies at all. This page explains how the site
        works without them, in line with the GDPR (Regulation EU 2016/679), the Spanish LOPDGDD (Organic
        Law 3/2018) and Article 22.2 of the LSSI-CE.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">1. What a cookie is</h2>
      <p>
        A cookie is a small file a website saves on your computer or phone so that it can recognise you on a
        later visit. Spanish law requires sites to say whether they use them and, unless they are strictly
        technical, to ask before setting them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">2. No cookies, nothing stored on your device</h2>
      <p>
        No cookie is placed on this site, whether technical, preference, analytics or advertising, and no
        data is kept in your browser's local storage. The net salary, IRPF, extra-pay, unemployment and
        mortgage calculators run inside your browser: what you type is never sent to a server and disappears
        when you leave the page. That is why the site has no cookie banner: there is nothing to accept.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">3. Anonymous stability check with cookieless Microsoft Clarity</h2>
      <p>
        To find technical faults (script errors, slow loading, dead clicks, scrolling problems) we use
        <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> without cookies. Before its script loads, the page tells Clarity
        that storage is denied, so it sets none of <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code>
        or <code>CLID</code>; each page view receives a new identifier and visits are never linked. Page text
        and anything typed into a form are masked in your browser before anything leaves it.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Provider and controller for this measurement:</strong> Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland.</li>
        <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> the technical stability and speed of the site, nothing else.</li>
        <li><strong>Retention:</strong> 30 days for technical recordings, at most 13 months for aggregated figures.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal basis:</strong> legitimate interest (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR) in calculators that work properly.</li>
        <li><strong>Opting out:</strong> block <code>clarity.ms</code> in your browser, or e-mail us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Microsoft's privacy statement:
        <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" class="text-brand hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement</a>.
        We use no Google Analytics, no advertising and no social-media pixels or other trackers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">4. Hosting logs</h2>
      <p>
        Our host, OVH, automatically logs IP address, date and requested page for security and operation of
        the service. These logs involve no cookie.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">5. Your rights and complaints</h2>
      <p>
        Radif Partners keeps no personal data about you, so there is nothing for us to show or delete. You may
        still write to us with any question, and you can lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection
        Agency (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" class="text-brand hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aepd.es</a>).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email: <a href="mailto:contact@elsueldoneto.es" class="text-brand hover:underline">contact@elsueldoneto.es</a>.
        See also our <a href="/en/privacy-policy/" class="text-brand hover:underline">privacy policy</a> and
        <a href="/en/legal-notice/" class="text-brand hover:underline">legal notice</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqPageSchema)} />
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      {faqPage.map((f) => (
        <details class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4 dark:border-gray-700">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">{f.question}</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">{f.answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
